    "body": "## Fix\r\n\r\nFix the PowerShell Editor Services command path so the server starts correctly with both manually configured `bundle_path` and automatically detected module paths.\r\n\r\nThe existing automatic module path discovery is preserved; this change corrects how the resolved path is used to construct the server command.\r\n\r\nAlso update the `vim.lsp.config` documentation examples to make `bundle_path` usage clearer.\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-17T11:42:56Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/pull/4532#discussion_r4013779004"
                },
                "pull_request": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/pulls/4532"
                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/pulls/comments/4013779004"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "use a ternary. and don't define a `command_fmt` (same for the `command_fmt` cases).\n\n\n```suggestion\n  command = bundle_path and ([[& '%s/%s/%s']]):format(bundle_path, module, script) or ''\n```",
            "commit_id": "cf72f53c141069fdc8d1e5c8737cfcb5d65b860d",
            "created_at": "2026-09-15T08:53:35Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -54,9 +54,14 @@ local function make_cmd()\n     return nil, string.format(\"Executable '%s' not found in system PATH.\", shell)\n   end\n \n+  local command = ''\n   local bundle_path = vim.lsp.config.powershell_es.bundle_path --[[@as string]]\n-  if not bundle_path or bundle_path == '' then\n-    local module = 'PowerShellEditorServices'\n+  local module = 'PowerShellEditorServices'\n+  local script = 'Start-EditorServices.ps1'\n+  if bundle_path then\n+    local command_fmt = [[& '%s/%s/%s']]\n+    command = command_fmt:format(bundle_path, module, script)\n+  else",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/nvim-lspconfig/pull/4532#discussion_r4013779004",
